  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Protect existing VMs during clone by @rksharma-owg in https://github.com/openai/tart/pull/1331\r\n* fix(control-socket): recover from transient accept errors by @rksharma-owg in https://github.com/openai/tart/pull/1351\r\n* --net-host: use VZVmnetNetworkDeviceAttachment with VMNET_HOST_MODE by @edi-oai in https://github.com/openai/tart/pull/1356\r\n* Ignore commented-out bootptab reservations by @LittleYier in https://github.com/openai/tart/pull/1358\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/openai/tart/compare/2.40.0...2.40.1",
